WEBVTT

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:44.510
Did you hear?

00:01:44.510 --> 00:01:48.540
Last night, Taurus Aldebaran died.

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:53.550
He was really beaten up and
wasn't in any shape to fight.

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:57.720
But why was he fighting
outside the twelve houses?

00:01:58.210 --> 00:02:03.520
Apparently, he was defending a Bronze Saint the Specters targeted.

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:04.720
A Bronze?

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:07.350
I heard it was the Pegasus Saint.

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:21.370
<i>Guilt, regret, impatience, anger...</i>

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:24.180
<i>I feel it all.</i>

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:26.870
<i>There's no time to waste.</i>

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:30.120
<i>I shouldn't be here in the Sanctuary!</i>

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:38.800
Shion!

00:02:41.740 --> 00:02:43.390
Have you found Tenma?

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:45.520
I can't find him anywhere.

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:47.890
It looks like he took his Cloth.

00:02:48.490 --> 00:02:52.900
That kid... He was really concerned
about Sisyphos and Alone.

00:02:58.430 --> 00:02:59.700
I just hope...

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:04.200
Aldebaran's death doesn't prompt
him to do something stupid.

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:08.370
You're right. In a crisis like this,

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:10.210
he could be charged with desertion.

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:12.390
Thanks, Shion.

00:03:12.390 --> 00:03:14.990
You were the only one
I could think of to ask for help

00:03:14.990 --> 00:03:16.710
with this bothersome task.

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:18.130
Bothersome?

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:20.080
That's for sure.

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:21.830
But knowing that he's like your kid brother,

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:23.220
I couldn't ignore it.

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:24.720
I'll help you until he's found.

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:26.640
I owe you one, Shion!

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:44.770
Teneo...

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:48.300
Saro's finally managed to settle down.

00:03:50.150 --> 00:03:51.560
Yeah... Thanks,

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:52.500
Celintha.

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:56.790
What?

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.000
What's with the funny face?

00:04:11.650 --> 00:04:15.410
I'm thinking I want to give up
trying to become a Saint.

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:20.990
After all, I came here so I could be with him.

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:23.840
Soon after I started training,

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:27.030
I realized I didn't have what
it takes to become a Saint.

00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:29.530
Celintha!

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:34.000
But I won't run from this Holy War.

00:04:34.610 --> 00:04:38.320
There's a lot I can do to help,
besides becoming a Saint.

00:04:40.490 --> 00:04:42.380
Remember Sir Aldebaran saying so?

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:44.440
You don't have to become a Saint,

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:45.800
you don't have to be on the battlefield.

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:48.270
Just be strong and kind.

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:53.520
I really believed that when the Holy War ended,

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:56.810
Sir Aldebaran would return to Sir Rasgado.

00:04:58.230 --> 00:05:00.580
But that wasn't to be.

00:05:03.460 --> 00:05:05.070
You have to carry the torch.

00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:09.300
Teneo,

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:14.420
someday, you should take on
Sir Rasgado's name, Aldebaran.

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:19.290
Someday, you should take
the Taurus Gold Saint's name,

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:22.490
Aldebaran, and his Cloth.

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:26.840
M-Me?

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:29.720
Become the man who deserves it.

00:05:31.980 --> 00:05:32.730
Okay.

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:34.730
I will.

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:41.730
We will not let him down.

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:45.840
That's right. Saro will understand
when he grows up.

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:48.980
Just as he taught us,
we must live on strongly.

00:06:06.820 --> 00:06:08.130
Huh?

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:10.340
Are you the Pegasus Saint?

00:06:11.690 --> 00:06:14.640
Don't wander around somewhere like this.
We're in crisis.

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:18.140
Not that I can talk, I guess.

00:06:19.610 --> 00:06:20.650
Who are you?

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:22.410
Me?

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:26.000
I'm the Gold Saint Cancer Manigold.

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:28.400
Dohko and Shion were looking for you.

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:32.830
Just let me go.

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:34.910
I won't return to the Sanctuary.

00:06:35.430 --> 00:06:40.360
It's my fault Aldebaran died.
It's better if I'm not there.

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:41.420
Huh?

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:44.250
Why do you think that?

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:47.260
That's what the Specter
with the black flames said.

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:51.410
That Pandora would continue
to send assassins after me.

00:06:52.230 --> 00:06:54.330
If I stay in the Sanctuary,

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:57.020
someone else will die again,
like Aldebaran.

00:06:57.490 --> 00:07:01.400
So I'll leave and wage the Holy War on my own!

00:07:02.010 --> 00:07:02.900
That's why...

00:07:07.170 --> 00:07:11.410
For a Bronze, you're pretty full of yourself.

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:15.410
I don't know why you're worried about that.

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:18.100
This is war.

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:21.920
Taurus died because he was weak, right?

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:23.420
What?

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:26.930
When there's a war, people die.

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:29.920
While we're on the subject,
let me break this to you, too.

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:33.750
You're running away from the Sanctuary

00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:35.680
because you're also weak.

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:42.060
Desertion is punishable by death.

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:50.070
Anyway...

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:53.530
You're best friends with the body
the King of the Underworld inhabits,

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:55.310
and you're useful.

00:07:55.310 --> 00:07:57.580
I can't kill you.

00:07:58.010 --> 00:08:01.080
But it doesn't look like
you're willing to go quietly.

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:01.710
Come.

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:18.100
See ya! I'll bust you out when I can use you.

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:21.730
Wait!

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:24.730
Let me out now! Let me out of here!

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:29.160
Manigold! Let me out!

00:08:32.460 --> 00:08:33.360
Crap!

00:08:35.420 --> 00:08:39.290
What's this made of, anyway?

00:08:43.130 --> 00:08:45.190
What am I doing?

00:08:48.690 --> 00:08:51.570
Damn it... I'm useful?

00:08:51.570 --> 00:08:53.270
That bastard, Manigold...

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:59.640
If those two saw me now,
they'd really kick my ass.

00:09:00.710 --> 00:09:04.300
<i>Only you, his former friend, can stop Hades!</i>

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:06.850
<i>Take care of Athena for me.</i>

00:09:08.470 --> 00:09:10.230
Look at me.

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:11.940
What can I do?

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:15.450
Wait. That black flame Specter...

00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:21.180
He said that Pandora essentially controls
the Specter army now.

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:25.000
But what does that mean? Alone...

00:09:25.800 --> 00:09:28.770
What on Earth are you doing?

00:09:33.020 --> 00:09:35.070
Dullahan Cube and the other's Cosmo
has disappeared,

00:09:35.070 --> 00:09:39.190
along with one of the twelve zodiac signs, Taurus.

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:43.140
However, Pegasus remains.

00:09:43.830 --> 00:09:45.310
They must have failed.

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:49.400
Dam you, Pegasus Saint!

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:54.120
If this gets back to the twin gods...

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:58.940
No, worse, if Lord Hades were
to find out that

00:09:58.940 --> 00:10:00.910
I was controlling the
Specter army on my own...

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:05.730
No... I just have to get rid of the Pegasus Saint,
once and for all, and everything will be fine.

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:10.880
The kind-hearted Lord Hades would understand...

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:15.420
just how much I love him.

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:18.930
And I've devoted myself to
the Specter army's service!

00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:25.390
All right. Just this once,
I will have mercy on your soul

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:28.890
and forgive your failure
to assassinate the Pegasus Saint.

00:10:36.910 --> 00:10:38.660
We do.

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:41.950
However, Lord Hades may not.

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:44.110
Lord Hades...

00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:46.450
Pandora!

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:49.360
See, Lord Hades is calling you.

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:53.170
Explain why you went off on your own.

00:10:54.730 --> 00:10:55.810
Pandora!

00:10:55.810 --> 00:10:56.420
Y-Yes!

00:10:56.980 --> 00:10:59.490
Will you take your scolding in silence?

00:11:00.530 --> 00:11:03.470
Or will you make excuses?

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:09.980
Either way, he'll punish you
without finding out your intentions.

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:15.240
And he'll be further detached
from you than he is now.

00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:20.440
I told you before...

00:11:20.440 --> 00:11:22.730
If you can't handle this,

00:11:22.730 --> 00:11:26.120
we will prepare a special atelier for him.

00:11:26.710 --> 00:11:31.300
A silent place, where nothing will distract him.

00:11:31.300 --> 00:11:34.990
You will take him there and lock him in.

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:36.830
<i>Lock...</i>

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:38.630
I cannot.

00:11:39.690 --> 00:11:42.320
I cannot betray Lord Hades. I love him!

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:46.930
If you do not, no matter how hard you try,

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:49.640
he will return to the Pegasus Saint again.

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:54.990
It is in no way a betrayal.

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:58.370
You said you love him.

00:11:58.370 --> 00:12:03.150
All you will do is help him be
what he should.

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:06.410
Yes, to be with you!

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:09.190
I'll help you, Pandora.

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:18.880
It's all for Lord Hades.

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:38.550
Lord Hades...

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:47.700
You're late, Pandora.

00:12:50.470 --> 00:12:53.320
I heard that you set Violate to shadowing me.

00:12:53.320 --> 00:12:56.220
Moreover, you took control of
the Specters without permission,

00:12:56.220 --> 00:12:58.710
and you ordered the Pegasus Saint's assassination.

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:00.720
To think you behaved so selfishly...

00:13:00.720 --> 00:13:01.830
It's unforgivable!

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:03.720
Stay away from me.
I don't want to see you now.

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:05.770
Repent!

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:11.720
Please tell me just one thing.

00:13:12.650 --> 00:13:16.230
Why do you still cling to the Pegasus Saint?

00:13:17.240 --> 00:13:20.560
I do not cling to the Pegasus Saint's memory.

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:23.690
I focus only on completing the Lost Canvas

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:25.730
and completing my plans.

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:27.240
Lord Hades...

00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:30.740
<i>He is our god, after all.</i>

00:13:40.550 --> 00:13:44.380
Lord Hades, the painting in the middle is...

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:49.500
A piece installed to complete the Lost Canvas.

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:51.640
It's my salvation.

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:56.210
I understand.

00:13:56.210 --> 00:14:00.900
The memory of the young boy,
whose body you inhabit, taints you.

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:05.900
With his filthy, human soul!

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:13.820
This is an atelier created in
the disturbance of space.

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:18.290
Please focus on the Lost Canvas there!

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:21.290
Your soul will be cleaned eventually, as well.

00:14:35.490 --> 00:14:36.810
<i>Please forgive me.</i>

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:39.390
<i>This is also for the Specter army... No,</i>

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:41.310
<i>for Lord Hades's sake.</i>

00:14:43.310 --> 00:14:46.110
Rhadamanthys, call Aiacos!

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:12.990
There's nothing I can do.

00:15:12.990 --> 00:15:15.220
If I want to know how Alone is doing,

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:17.100
I just have to go see him.

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:19.430
I can't be stuck in here...

00:15:19.820 --> 00:15:21.960
forever!

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:23.610
Break, damn you!

00:15:30.980 --> 00:15:33.570
Back off for just a second, you idiot.

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:37.070
Y-Yato, you've come to help?

00:15:37.070 --> 00:15:39.050
I thought you were in Jamir.

00:15:39.050 --> 00:15:42.080
I'll explain later. Let's go!

00:15:43.140 --> 00:15:46.650
Whenever I'm with you,
I always get the short end of the stick.

00:15:49.100 --> 00:15:52.090
<i>How does he know about this path?</i>

00:16:00.360 --> 00:16:02.830
Good work, Yato, Tenma.

00:16:06.310 --> 00:16:08.110
<i>A Silver Saint?</i>

00:16:08.520 --> 00:16:09.610
<i>Pursuing us?</i>

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:10.950
Bring it on!

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:12.610
Wait, wait! Look carefully!

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:15.620
And don't you stay silent. Speak for yourself!

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:18.370
That's why I said a mask wasn't a good idea.

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:19.620
Huh?

00:16:20.730 --> 00:16:22.400
Is it okay, Tenma?

00:16:22.400 --> 00:16:24.620
I'm now Crane Yuzuriha.

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:27.460
Yuzuriha? You've become a Saint?

00:16:28.810 --> 00:16:32.540
Yeah, I had already passed the tests,

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:34.880
but I hadn't gotten my Cloth back
from the Sanctuary.

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:38.380
The Master said this was a good opportunity,
so I brought it,

00:16:38.380 --> 00:16:41.000
and it turned out to be Silver,
higher than my Bronze.

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:43.390
What a shock.

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:45.100
This is mine?

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:46.930
I thought Manigold took it away.

00:16:46.930 --> 00:16:48.400
We must leave now! Hurry!

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:51.250
I don't really understand,

00:16:51.250 --> 00:16:53.900
but I'm sure that old man's behind all this.

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:55.650
Don't call him an old man.

00:16:56.450 --> 00:17:02.410
The job that old man gave us
was getting you out.

00:17:02.410 --> 00:17:04.410
Yato, not you, too.

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:07.740
Tenma, you'd get caught right away.

00:17:07.740 --> 00:17:08.610
Shut up!

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:13.720
Anyway, let's just get out of the Sanctuary.

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:16.900
Then we'll stick with you as long as you want.

00:17:16.900 --> 00:17:19.250
Hey, Yato. Then I...

00:17:19.250 --> 00:17:20.570
Yeah, what?

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:22.930
I want to go to Hades's castle!

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:24.440
Huh?

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:30.490
Protecting the Pegasus Saint?

00:17:30.490 --> 00:17:34.320
Yes. As evidenced by the enemy's assassins,

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:38.160
it is clear that he is important
to the Holy War.

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:41.830
We cannot lose him.

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:44.580
In that part of the Sanctuary,

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:46.970
the enemy will have difficulty reaching him.

00:17:46.970 --> 00:17:48.830
Please understand.

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:50.670
<i>It's true,</i>

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:53.640
<i>if the Pegasus Saint were attacked now,
we would lose any leverage over Hades.</i>

00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:58.800
<i>My big brother's soul... That's Pandora's goal.</i>

00:17:59.790 --> 00:18:00.850
<i>But...</i>

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:02.150
<i>But!</i>

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:04.130
I understand.

00:18:04.130 --> 00:18:05.420
Lady Athena.

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:10.690
The sense of duty you must feel,
when you are responsible

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:13.590
for protecting peace on Earth,
is impressive.

00:18:13.590 --> 00:18:16.110
But don't fool yourself.

00:18:16.710 --> 00:18:19.230
You are the Master of Jamir!

00:18:19.230 --> 00:18:22.120
It's been a long time. Athena, Pope.

00:18:22.940 --> 00:18:24.370
Now, Lady Athena.

00:18:24.990 --> 00:18:30.650
I feel that we should do as Tenma
wishes here, don't you think?

00:18:31.910 --> 00:18:34.740
You mean we should watch him go to his death?

00:18:34.740 --> 00:18:36.510
It's not necessarily to his death.

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:40.110
On the contrary, one's soul may
show even more strength

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:41.390
when faced with death.

00:18:42.200 --> 00:18:43.810
If we're only able to let him live,

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:45.730
the Pegasus Saint's wings will eventually break.

00:18:45.730 --> 00:18:47.040
We must make use of him.

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:50.900
Without a living Pegasus Saint,
even a single arrow won't reach King Hades.

00:18:51.430 --> 00:18:54.400
King Hades's... No, Alone's soul.

00:18:56.630 --> 00:19:00.150
That was surely your hope and your wish,

00:19:00.690 --> 00:19:02.020
Lady Sasha.

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:04.590
He hasn't already...

00:19:04.590 --> 00:19:06.660
You catch on quickly.

00:19:07.320 --> 00:19:10.420
Right about now,
my people are helping him escape.

00:19:11.740 --> 00:19:13.180
You may be a powerful man,

00:19:13.180 --> 00:19:15.000
but you cannot simply do as
you wish within the Sanctuary.

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:18.090
No, I had to go over your head.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:21.650
It's quite understandable that you made the
decision to lock up the Pegasus Saint,

00:19:21.650 --> 00:19:25.560
as you are the Pope who must
oversee all of the Sanctuary.

00:19:26.230 --> 00:19:28.960
I knew you wouldn't be able
to overturn your decision easily.

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:30.060
So that is why...

00:19:30.930 --> 00:19:36.570
I am telling you that I will at least take
full responsibility for the Pegasus Saint.

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:43.350
I have not been informed of
the Pegasus Saint's desertion.

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:49.000
Even if I were, I do not have the means
to go after a single Bronze Saint.

00:19:49.810 --> 00:19:51.380
That seems the case.

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:55.790
If there is anything you haven't said, say it now,

00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:57.550
Lady Sasha.

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:17.940
It seems it isn't only Hades and Pandora
whom we must watch.

00:20:18.450 --> 00:20:22.950
Yes. The presence of those who are
wriggling around in their shadows...

00:20:42.070 --> 00:20:44.970
The Pegasus Saint's Cosmo shines brighter.

00:20:49.710 --> 00:20:53.130
I see their connection from
the days of myths remains strong.

00:20:53.130 --> 00:20:56.290
He will cling to Lord Hades,
no matter what it takes.

00:20:57.480 --> 00:20:59.360
What a fool.

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:01.200
Lord Hades is already in somewhere

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:06.490
no one can reach him. Thanks to you, Pandora.

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:08.350
You are content, are you not?

00:21:10.480 --> 00:21:11.990
The sound is out of tune.

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.690
That's enough.

00:21:15.690 --> 00:21:18.070
It will soon be over with the Pegasus Saint.

00:21:18.070 --> 00:21:18.920
Over?

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:19.960
Of course.

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:22.760
We'll ensure it ourselves.

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:25.440
Be thankful, Pandora.

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:28.260
We've raised a barrier around Hades's castle.

00:21:30.770 --> 00:21:35.180
The Pegasus Saint will lay down his life,
without even reaching the castle.

00:21:35.180 --> 00:21:39.080
Death... Where fear and despair meet Thanatos.

00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:52.820
We made it here pretty easily.

00:21:52.820 --> 00:21:55.500
The Master must have made
the necessary preparations.

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:58.250
I owe you two again.

00:21:59.460 --> 00:22:02.630
Well, things will really get hard now.

00:22:03.100 --> 00:22:05.880
We're heading for Hades's castle. Oh, well.

00:22:06.520 --> 00:22:08.740
This might be our last time seeing the Sanctuary.

00:22:10.410 --> 00:22:11.830
If this was how it was going to be,

00:22:11.830 --> 00:22:13.300
I wish I could've seen
Lady Athena at least once.

00:22:13.300 --> 00:22:14.970
Don't be so pessimistic.

00:22:14.970 --> 00:22:15.900
<i>Sasha...</i>

00:22:16.380 --> 00:22:19.510
<i>It's going to be real tough fighting Alone,</i>

00:22:19.510 --> 00:22:21.430
<i>when we were so close.</i>

00:22:21.430 --> 00:22:24.480
<i>I can't explain it well, but...</i>

00:22:24.900 --> 00:22:27.450
T-Tenma! Look over there!

00:22:30.130 --> 00:22:30.910
Could it be...

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:40.590
Lady Athena...

00:22:40.590 --> 00:22:42.040
<i>Athena is...</i>

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:43.290
<i>Sasha...</i>

00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:45.720
<i>I'll keep my promise.</i>

00:22:49.350 --> 00:22:50.840
<i>For the day all three of us</i>

00:22:50.840 --> 00:22:53.480
<i>laugh together again.</i>

00:22:53.480 --> 00:22:54.730
Everything...

00:22:56.700 --> 00:22:59.480
I'll cut through it all!

00:23:01.170 --> 00:23:04.350
Athena! No, Sasha!
